    "title": "FNF Restored.EXE Full Mod 4.0",
    "description": "Enjoy your best funkin Friday night ever with BF in EXE.World!\r\nThis is a funkin mod based on an ongoing webcomic with the same name. While, Tail is walking by himself in Green Hill Zone, Boyfriend and Girlfriend emerge from the shadows, and force him to rap. So, finally, Tail have to battle against Shadow, Sonik, and Nuckles,...\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n- Make arrows perfectly match.\r\n- Beat all enemies (Blue V1, Finn,...), climb to the top rank!\r\n- Feel funkin rhythm! Dance with cg5! Rock the beat!\r\n\r\nFUNKIN FEATURE\r\n- Arrows fall follow funkin melody\r\n- Full mods Full enemies as you expected (GF, Suicide mouse, Sally, Rainbow friends...)\r\n- Fantastic background with great sound effects\r\n- Always save your funkin journey while you exit the game\r\n- Be updated frequently!\r\n\r\nHave fun!\r\nUgh! Don't forget follow our media platforms to join in a vibrant FNF community game.",
